 Milton\u2019s Paradise Lost.\n\nWhich ways will you choose? The paths to paradise or hell?", "short_description": "Inspired by Sleep-No-More and The Under Presents: Tempest. We attempt to build an immersive theater related to Mary Shelley\u2019s inspirations that led her to create the famous sci-fi gothic novel - Frankenstein, or The Modern Prometheus."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sciencevr.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sciencevr.com/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "ScienceVR, Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://sciencevr.com/support", "website_url": "https://sciencevr.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "DOCUMENTARY_HISTORY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2019569808224187"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003273_856589138238217_2884949979322780009_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nnF_PcktgNIQ7kNvwFd1NAH&_nc_oc=Adrkssh0R9O4cvjW5DsoqUuaoOLtJGnf2uRpPB-bj2EM8XYOFVs78LAsuYMJb7ajABI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRZSXut88kXMX5iGN0OI68locRoAapkjmrlLfrzpBQ_ag&oe=6B0088E8"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Shelley's Cr